{"version":1,"content":"<p>鄭丹瑞和太太育有兩名女兒，繼大女鄭瑤前年結婚並於今年3月誕下女兒後，細女鄭珉（Amanda）亦於昨天（2日）無預警在社交平台發文，宣布已跟外籍男友攜手邁入人生新階段，令鄭家喜訊連連！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:58:38.842462+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:09:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:37.972514+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:58:38.842462+00:00","content_hash":"21f46b1612f3cdc2d7c10b24eb2140dbbfa2f081829edf398069790f759a4250","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}